<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">Congratulations on your decision to attend Arizona State University! Please complete your <b>Priority Tasks</b> as soon as possible by logging in to <a href="http://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Your Priority Tasks may include:</b></font></div><div><ol><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Pay the enrollment deposit</b> – Once you pay this, you can confirm your <a href="https://housing.asu.edu/">housing preferences</a> and contact your academic advisor to schedule your classes.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>English proficiency </b>– Have your TOEFL or IELTS score sent directly to ASU.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>MMR immunization</b> – Email proof of <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/health/immunization">immunization</a> to <a href="mailto:measles@asu.edu">measles@asu.edu</a>.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Financial guarantee</b> – Email <a href="https://international.asu.edu/financialguarantee">financial guarantee form</a> to <a href="mailto:fg@asu.edu">fg@asu.edu</a>.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Financial documents</b> – Email <a href="https://international.asu.edu/financialguarantee">financial documents</a> showing at least $41,870 to <a href="fg@asu.edu">fg@asu.edu</a>.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>I-20 questions</b> – Answer the questions "Are you in the USA?" and "Choose </span>I-20<span style="font-size: 12pt;"> delivery option." We highly recommend selecting the <b>expedited delivery</b> option for two reasons:</span></li><ol><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">If you choose traditional mail, there will not be a method of tracking the expected delivery date or to find a lost package.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">It can take several weeks via traditional mail, causing </span>delay<span style="font-size: 12pt;"> in getting your Visa interview set up and your I-20 issued.</span></li></ol><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Final foreign high school transcript</b> – Bring your official transcripts (clearly showing your graduate date) to <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=63156">Admission Services</a> when you arrive on campus.</span></li></ol></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">For more details about the items listed above, please refer to our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/international/future/undergrad">international undergraduate admission requirements</a> or contact me. I am here to help you through the admission process.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>